        "description": {
          "ko": "2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다.",
          "en": "In 2125 he broke open the snow-blocked transfer passage and moved the injured first. By this deed the signature of the work-squad courier post rose into the ledger."
        },
        "behavior": {
          "ko": "2125년 폭설에 막힌 환승 통로를 뚫어 부상자를 먼저 옮겼다.",
          "en": "In 2125 he broke open the snow-blocked transfer passage and moved the injured first. By this deed the signature of the work-squad courier post rose into the ledger."
        },
        "stress": {
          "ko": "작업반 전령 당직이 비면 규격맹의 통행이 강국 볼모가 되는 것.",
          "en": "That the work-squad courier duty post would stand empty and the Alliance's passage would become a hostage of the great powers."
